      "text": [
        "2289 - وَ كَانَ عَلِيٌّ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ يَفْتَخِرُ عَلَى اَلصَّحَابَةِ وَ يَقُولُ «مَنْ فِيكُمْ مِثْلِي وَ أَنَا شَرِيكُ رَسُولِ اَللَّهِ صَلَّى اَللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَ آلِهِ فِي هَدْيِهِ مَنْ فِيكُمْ مِثْلِي وَ أَنَا اَلَّذِي ذَبَحَ رَسُولُ اَللَّهِ صَلَّى اَللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَ آلِهِ هَدْيِي بِيَدِهِ»."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.2289 - Imam Ali ibn Abi Talib (as) would take pride among the companions and say:\n\"Who among you is like me? I am the partner of the Messenger of Allah (swt) (peace and blessings be upon him and his family) in his sacrificial offering. Who among you is like me? I am the one whose sacrificial offering the Messenger of Allah (swt) (peace and blessings be upon him and his family) slaughtered with his own hand.\""
        ]
      }
    },
